<title>GERMANY: VW details 1997 Q1 sales by group brands.</title>
<headline>VW details 1997 Q1 sales by group brands.</headline>
<dateline>WOLFSBURG, Germany 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First three months of 1997 (in millions on units)</p>
<p>    Group deliveries to customers	  1,033,785 vs 943,211</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --Volkswagen				 734,731 up 7.4 pct</p>
<p>    --Skoda					68,049  up 21.4 pct</p>
<p>    --Audi					 137,129 up 18.9 pct</p>
<p>    --Seat					 93,876  up 7.8 pct</p>
<p>    Group sales to dealers		   1,027,073 vs 980,788</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>    --Volkswagen				 673,407 up 1.5 pct</p>
<p>    --Audi					 133,559 up 8.3 pct</p>
<p>    --Seat					 96,591  up 10.9 pct</p>
<p>    --Skoda					75,608  up 20.8 pct</p>
<p>    --Volkswagen trucks			47,908  up 8.8 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German carmaker is Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
